a’o;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tsy hipisañe ama’o i tariñandrokey,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ndra i volañey te haleñe.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Hañaro azo amy ze fonga haratiañe","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"t’Iehovà;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho ho tamirie’e ty fiai’o.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Harova’ Iehovà ty fiengà’o","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho ty fiziliha’o","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"henane zao vaho nainai’e donia.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/tdx_sle/PSA/121.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/tdx_sle/PSA/122.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/tdx_sle/PSA/120.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}